# New game path for the D2 captures; timings are vblanks at 60 Hz.
wait state 2
wait 600
capture title
press CROSS 6
wait 240
capture gname-select-character
press CROSS 6
wait 180
capture gname-select-weapon
press CROSS 6
wait state 3
wait 300
capture gname-name-entry
press CROSS 6
wait state 5
wait 180
capture wsel-room
press CROSS 6
wait 120
capture wsel-prompt
press CROSS 6
wait 120
capture wsel-cursor
press CROSS 6
wait 120
capture wsel-cursor-confirmed
